# Temperance marker — cli#254 CI token wire
- date: 2026-09-27
- branch: feat/254-ci-token-wire
- ceremony-class: (b) small extension — workflow YAML wiring
- prior: sub-steps 5+6 shipped (PR #264 merged fbb2f8c); operator
  landed Steps 1+2 (PAT created + SMOKE_GH_TOKEN Actions secret set)
- scope-decision:
  - right-thing: pass SMOKE_GH_TOKEN + GH_SMOKE_REPO into the docker
    smoke run so the V2i interactive step can route /promote-style
    ticket creates at the sandbox repo.
  - right-way: keep the anticorruption layer per RFC-0002 R9 —
    docker run passes ONLY the documented env vars, never the full
    runner env. Add `permissions:` at workflow level to narrow the
    default GITHUB_TOKEN. Update Report/Fail-job case statements to
    name interactive exit codes 30-34.
  - drift-trigger: any additional env passed into docker run beyond
    CLI_VERSION + auth tokens + GH_SMOKE_REPO is drift.
- blast-radius:
  - inside scope: .github/workflows/docker-smoke.yml only.
  - outside scope: harness code (sub-steps 5+6 already shipped);
    sandbox repo permissions (operator-side, Steps 1+2 done);
    GitHub App migration (future ticket).
- authorization: agent-merges-within-scope.
